== 6b. Pre-merge self-review of the diff (the advisor tool used earlier in this session is not available now;
    recorded honestly as a self-review, not an external one)
raw/43_r100_review_findings_old_vs_fixed.log — same script against safety.py at 9a0698a and the fixed file:
   1. NAT64 64:ff9b::a9fe:a9fe (=169.254.169.254) and 64:ff9b::7f00:1 counted as public  -> fixed (embedded IPv4 checked)
      (6to4 2002:7f00:1::1 was already non-public via Python's is_global — finding not confirmed, test kept)
   2. SQLite randomblob(1000000000) allocated ~1 GB inside the server                      -> fixed (SQLITE_LIMIT_LENGTH 1 MB)
   3. invalid UTF-8 from the child raised UnicodeDecodeError in the handler                -> fixed (errors="replace")
   4. a descendant that left the process group kept communicate() blocked (>5 s)           -> fixed (bounded wait, 3.0 s)
   5. docstrings named a non-existent evidence file (27_r100_probe_before.log)             -> fixed
   7 regression tests added (44 in tests/test_r100_runtime_safety.py).
