== 7. Residual limits (SECURITY.md, R-100 section)
Child runs as the server's own user (can read app files, open sockets) — hence execution itself is policy-gated;
DNS rebinding between check and connect is not covered; a runaway query holds the server up to 3 s; the
non-dumpable flag is Linux-only (reported in /api/system/status).
